  "i18n": {
    "en": {
      "path": "/en/collection/world-polymer/hong-kong-10-dollars-2007/",
      "title": "10 Dólares, Hong Kong Government, Polymer | Notofilia",
      "description": "Catalog record numismático: banknote de 10 dólares de Hong Kong, polymer, emitido por el Gobierno de la RAE de Hong Kong desde 2007. Pick-401.",
      "ogTitle": "Hong Kong Government — 10 Dólares de Polymer (2007)",
      "ogDescription": "Banknote of 10 dólares de Hong Kong, polymer: flor de bauhinia y patrones geométricos. Colección privada Notofilia.",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/world-polymer/hong-kong-10-dollars-2007/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Hong Kong Government — 10 Dólares (2007)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/world-polymer/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; World polymer banknote catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">World Polymer Banknotes &middot; Hong Kong &middot; 2007</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Hong Kong Government</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Ten Dollars &middot; Bauhinia Flower &middot; Special Administrative Region</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"hong-kong-10-dolares-2007-polimero\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/hongkong-hkma-10-dollars-2007-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/hongkong-hkma-10-dollars-2007-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote of 10 dólares de polymer del Hong Kong Government, obverse arriba con flor de bauhinia y caballo encabritado, reverse abajo con patrón geométrico y cinta de colores\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"546\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country/Region</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Hong Kong (Special Administrative Region of China)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Government of the Hong Kong SAR, through the Hong Kong Monetary Authority (HKMA)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Ten Hong Kong Dollars (10 HKD)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polymer &mdash; Guardian&trade; substrate, supplied by CCL Secure (formerly Securency)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Hong Kong Note Printing Limited (HKNPL)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Year of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2007 (first polymer issue of this designation; the paper version circulated since 2002)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatures</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Financial Secretary &middot; Hong Kong Monetary Authority</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">132 &times; 65 mm<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rarity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Current banknote, in active circulation along with more recent issues of the same denomination</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-401, Standard Catalog of World Paper Money (with subvarieties a&ndash;d)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">5</sup></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"hong-kong-10-dolares-2007-polimero\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/hongkong-hkma-10-dollars-2007-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/hongkong-hkma-10-dollars-2007-polimero.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of 10 dólares de polymer del Hong Kong Government, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The only banknote issued by the Government:</strong>unlike Hong Kong’s other denominations, issued by three authorized commercial banks, the $10 note is issued directly by the Hong Kong SAR Government through the HKMA. It was reintroduced in 2002 in response to public demand to retain the denomination as a banknote rather than only as a coin.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">6</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">From paper to polymer:</strong>the paper version circulated since 2002; In 2007 the Government adopted the polymer substrate for this denomination, printed in Hong Kong by HKNPL, the plant that HKMA acquired from the De La Rue group of the United Kingdom in 1996.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">7</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A portrait-free design:</strong>unlike many polymer banknotes worldwide, this denomination omits portraits and relies entirely on the bauhinia flower &mdash; Hong Kong’s floral symbol &mdash; and geometric patterns as its central motif.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Front and back:</strong>bauhinia flower and a rearing horse as a registration device, along with intricate geometric patterns.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">8</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Transparent panel:</strong>a central translucent window, a feature unique to the polymer substrate.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">9</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Watermark:</strong>a numerical image &ldquo;10&rdquo; visible from both sides of the note when held to the light.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">10</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Security thread:</strong>a straight metallic thread embedded in the banknote, clearly visible from both sides.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">11</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Matching registration:</strong>color patterns printed on the obverse and reverse that align exactly when held to the light.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">12</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Color:</strong>predominantly purple and pink tones, with a multicolored band on the reverse and the ideogram &ldquo;拾&rdquo; (ten) printed on both sides.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Additional Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Hong Kong maintains an unusual issuance system: the majority of its banknotes are issued by three authorized commercial banks (HSBC, Bank of China Hong Kong and Standard Chartered), while the Government, through the HKMA, exclusively issues the $10 note. This denomination is today the only polymer banknote in circulation in Hong Kong, within a monetary system that otherwise continues to print its highest value banknotes on cotton paper.</p>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Hong Kong Monetary Authority. &ldquo;Ten-Dollar Polymer Note.&rdquo;<em>hkma.gov.hk</em>: &ldquo;The Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region has issued the ten-dollar polymer note since 2007.&rdquo;</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Hong Kong Monetary Authority. &ldquo;Notes.&rdquo;<em>hkma.gov.hk</em>: Hong Kong banknotes printed by Hong Kong Note Printing Limited (HKNPL), a plant acquired by the HKMA from the De La Rue group in 1996.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">3. Wikipedia. &ldquo;Banknotes of the Hong Kong dollar&rdquo;: &ldquo;These notes were printed in paper in 2002 and have been printed in polymer plastic since 2007.&rdquo;</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">4. Banknote World. &ldquo;Hong Kong &mdash; Government 10 Dollars Banknote, 2014, P-401d, Polymer&rdquo;: dimensions of 132 &times; 65 mm.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">5. Banknote World, ibid.: cataloged as Pick-401d for the 2014 issue; the Pick-401 family covers polymer variants from 2007 onward.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">6. Wikipedia, &ldquo;Banknotes of the Hong Kong dollar&rdquo;: reintroduction of the $10 note by the HKMA in response to public demand following an attempt to replace it with coins between 1994 and 2002.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">7. Wikipedia, id.: acquisition of the Tai Po plant from the De La Rue group in April 1996, now operated as HKNPL.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">8. Banknote World. &ldquo;Hong Kong &mdash; Government 10 Dollars Banknote, 2014, P-401d, UNC, Polymer&rdquo;: bauhinia flower, rearing horse as a recording device and geometric patterns on front and back.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">9. Wikipedia, &ldquo;Banknotes of the Hong Kong dollar&rdquo;: &ldquo;The ten-dollar banknotes are made of polymer, and have a transparent panel.&rdquo;</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">10. Wikipedia, id.: numerical watermark visible from both sides of the banknote, without reaction to ultraviolet light.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">11. Wikipedia, id.: straight metal security thread, clearly visible from both sides of the banknote.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">12. Wikipedia, id.: color patterns on the front and back that line up exactly against the light when the banknote is held against the light.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Hong Kong Government",
      "eyebrow": "World Polymer Banknotes · Hong Kong · 2007"
    }
  }
